{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T23:59:30+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BeaureCard", "steam_appid": 2409270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beaurecard</strong></h2><strong>A path to the underworld has been opened and demons are roaming the lands of BeaureCard. Can you defeat the demon lord and save the world?</strong><br> <br>Gather powerful cards, strategically build your deck, and prepare to face the ultimate test of skill and strategy: an epic showdown against the demon lord. Will you be victorious or succumb to the perils that lie ahead? The fate of BeaureCard rests in your hands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game</strong></h2>Your deck is your health in BeaureCard! Prepare for quick and fast paced battles. Strive to deplete your opponents' deck, cleverly using traps, powers, blessings, and curses. In this true deckbuilder, you can freely add or remove cards to customize your deck and adapt to any situation. Embark on an epic adventure, with exciting events to explore, new cards to acquire, and dangerous demons.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409270/extras/a36373a29fe2d070c089ddce8533b9c5.poster.avif?t=1721674225\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409270/extras/a36373a29fe2d070c089ddce8533b9c5.webm?t=1721674225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409270/extras/a36373a29fe2d070c089ddce8533b9c5.mp4?t=1721674225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Your deck is your health!<br></li><li>Use traps that activate on deplete.<br></li><li>Use blessings and curses that can counter each other.<br></li><li>Freely add and remove cards from your deck.<br></li><li>3 unique characters with different play styles; even one where you draw from your opponent's deck!<br></li><li>Many unique events: Gamble, shop or travel mysterious roads. And maybe you will find a treasure? What risks are you willing to take to build the ultimate deck?<br></li><li>Short runs: an average run takes ~10-30 min.<br></li><li>100+ different cards.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beaurecard</strong></h2><strong>A path to the underworld has been opened and demons are roaming the lands of BeaureCard. Can you defeat the demon lord and save the world?</strong><br> <br>Gather powerful cards, strategically build your deck, and prepare to face the ultimate test of skill and strategy: an epic showdown against the demon lord. Will you be victorious or succumb to the perils that lie ahead? The fate of BeaureCard rests in your hands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game</strong></h2>Your deck is your health in BeaureCard! Prepare for quick and fast paced battles. Strive to deplete your opponents' deck, cleverly using traps, powers, blessings, and curses. In this true deckbuilder, you can freely add or remove cards to customize your deck and adapt to any situation. Embark on an epic adventure, with exciting events to explore, new cards to acquire, and dangerous demons.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409270/extras/a36373a29fe2d070c089ddce8533b9c5.poster.avif?t=1721674225\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409270/extras/a36373a29fe2d070c089ddce8533b9c5.webm?t=1721674225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409270/extras/a36373a29fe2d070c089ddce8533b9c5.mp4?t=1721674225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><